WEBVTT

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:03.774
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.682 --> 00:00:06.929
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m planning to buy a new car.

00:00:09.396 --> 00:00:10.038
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.627 --> 00:00:12.594
<v><b>B:</b></v> He decided to walk home.

00:00:14.961 --> 00:00:15.674
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:18.923
<v><b>A:</b></v> I hope to hear from you soon.

00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:21.906
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:24.674
<v><b>B:</b></v> Do you want to stop now?

00:00:26.955 --> 00:00:27.755
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:30.849
<v><b>A:</b></v> I need to go to the supermarket.

00:00:33.329 --> 00:00:34.191
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:37.353
<v><b>B:</b></v> They’d like to have dinner with us.